# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Cast the library's top spell through Bolas's Citadel using life.
# Forcing: No mana sources or cards in hand offer another way to cast Grizzly Bears.
# AI behavior: Empty hand and battlefield leave no response decisions.
# Failure modes: Missing action prevents casting; unchanged life disproves payment;
#   stale rail identity after casting exposes the old library top.
# Card roles: Citadel grants permission; Bears costs two life; Forest is the next top.
# Protocol path: Legal actions, casting, life update, and library visibility.
